    <Description>This Mini Neo Strafe macro is designed to imitate the quick directional changes and compact movement patterns used in Apex Legends mini neo strafing. It focuses on rapid left-and-right movement inputs with carefully tuned delays to create smooth, responsive transitions and a consistent strafe rhythm. The goal is to help reproduce the tight, controlled movement style associated with mini neo strafing while keeping the pattern fluid and minimizing unnecessary pauses between inputs. Timing and input consistency are important, so the macro should be tested and adjusted to match your keyboard settings, movement configuration, and overall gameplay feel. Start by testing it in the Firing Range, where you can observe the movement pattern, evaluate how the inputs interact with your controls, and make adjustments as needed. Results may vary depending on your configuration, and automated movement inputs may be restricted by Apex Legends' rules or anti-cheat systems.</Description>
